OL,5,G0350 Long Lost Family
OL,6,     FMark Thorpe has always wondered
OL,7,     Fabout the identity of the baby in
OL,8,     Fthe photo by his late mum's bed
OL,9,     Fsince he was a little boy. After
OL,10,     FMark's mum revealed that she'd had
OL,11,     Fa son before him who was placed
OL,12,     Ffor adoption, he now yearns to
OL,13,     Ffind his older brother. Jane
OL,14,     FLewis, who was taken into foster
OL,15,     Fcare when she was 11 days old
OL,16,     Fafter her mother disappeared,
OL,17,     Fwants to find the three other
OL,18,     Fchildren, all of whom were
OL,19,     Fbrothers, that her mother had
